# Local state lives under ~/.config/claude-airlock, never in the repo.
*.log

# Vendored dev tools (make bootstrap) — not committed.
.tooling/

# Corporate / internal CA certs never belong here: they live in the host's own
# /etc/claude-airlock/ca/ (docs/images.md). image/certs/ is only the no-root fallback
# (AIRLOCK_CA_DIR=clone), and the install builds only the certs it checked, so a committed
# one is never used.
#
# Ignored all the same, as a safety interlock: this repo is public, and a private PKI
# chain belongs to whoever's network it is. Nobody running `git add -A` on a work machine
# should be one keystroke away from publishing their employer's internal CA names.
image/certs/*.crt
